==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*15 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~24 seconds<sup>240f~720f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

